{"id":"b6311019c9acbb97","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-eff-topos.md","title":"有效拓扑斯","display":"df-effective-topos-construction — 有效拓扑斯","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-eff-topos","aliases":["16-df-eff-topos","Effective topos construction"],"display":"df-effective-topos-construction — 有效拓扑斯","depends_on":["[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]","[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","[[16-df-realizability-connectives]]","[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]","[[16-thm-set-p-topos]]"],"source":"Example 6.1.2(ii), pp. 376–377 (PDF 396–397); Example 6.1.8(ii), p. 383 (PDF 403)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-eff-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-eff-topos</span><span>Effective topos construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-topos-construction — 有效拓扑斯"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e315868bd6a1509\" href=\"?note=2e315868bd6a1509\" title=\"16-df-realizability-fibration\">16-df-realizability-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f36bc28426b1a7dc\" href=\"?note=f36bc28426b1a7dc\" title=\"16-df-realizability-connectives\">16-df-realizability-connectives</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55e5037ed821c800\" href=\"?note=55e5037ed821c800\" title=\"16-thm-set-p-topos\">16-thm-set-p-topos</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 6.1.2(ii), pp. 376–377 (PDF 396–397); Example 6.1.8(ii), p. 383 (PDF 403)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathbb N\">\\(A=\\mathbb N\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a> 的同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K_1\">\\(\\mathrm K_1\\)</span>、通用偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>，简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n\">\\(e\\cdot n=e\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(r_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e315868bd6a1509\" href=\"?note=2e315868bd6a1509\" title=\"16-df-realizability-fibration\">16-df-realizability-fibration</a> 的一致实现性纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(r_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(r_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a> 的关系构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(r_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(r_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f36bc28426b1a7dc\" href=\"?note=f36bc28426b1a7dc\" title=\"16-df-realizability-connectives\">16-df-realizability-connectives</a> 的显式运算得到，因而满足该关系构造的正则性前提。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 及分裂 tripos 的成拓扑斯结论采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55e5037ed821c800\" href=\"?note=55e5037ed821c800\" title=\"16-thm-set-p-topos\">16-thm-set-p-topos</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_L^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\iota_L^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2e315868bd6a1509\" href=\"?note=2e315868bd6a1509\" title=\"16-df-realizability-fibration\">16-df-realizability-fibration</a> 的正式编码。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I,J\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:I\\times I\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\rho:I\\times I\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:J\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\sigma:J\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>；对象构造的论域满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}_{r_{\\mathbb N}}(I,\\iota_{I\\times I}^{\\mathbb N}\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}_{r_{\\mathbb N}}(I,\\iota_{I\\times I}^{\\mathbb N}\\rho)\\)</span> 与对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 条件。关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:I\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(F:I\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 用于箭头构造时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_{r_{\\mathbb N}}(\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma);\\iota_{I\\times J}^{\\mathbb N}F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FuncRel}_{r_{\\mathbb N}}(\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma);\\iota_{I\\times J}^{\\mathbb N}F)\\)</span>；两个谓词和下式带指标的商类均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li>本页及引用本页的 Eff 原子中，裸谓词记法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\rho)\">\\((I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F]\">\\([F]\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma),[F]\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma),[F]\\rangle\\)</span> 分别简写下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)\">\\(\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EffArr}(I,\\rho;J,\\sigma;F)\">\\(\\mathsf{EffArr}(I,\\rho;J,\\sigma;F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F]\">\\([F]\\)</span> 的两个指标由固定源靶确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(i,i&#39;)\">\\(\\rho(i,i&#39;)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(i,j)\">\\(F(i,j)\\)</span> 始终指裸函数取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}topos\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\\quad \\mathbf{Eff}\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Set}(r_{\\mathbb N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}topos\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\\quad \\mathbf{Eff}\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Set}(r_{\\mathbb N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\iota_{I\\times I}^{\\mathbb N}\\rho)\n\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Eff},\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq[\\iota_{I\\times J}^{\\mathbb N}F]_{I,J},\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffArr}(I,\\rho;J,\\sigma;F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma),\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\in\\mathbf{Eff}(\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\iota_{I\\times I}^{\\mathbb N}\\rho)\n\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Eff},\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq[\\iota_{I\\times J}^{\\mathbb N}F]_{I,J},\\\\\n\\mathsf{EffArr}(I,\\rho;J,\\sigma;F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma),\\mathsf{EffRel}_{I,J}(F)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\in\\mathbf{Eff}(\\mathsf{EffObj}(I,\\rho),\\mathsf{EffObj}(J,\\sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathbf{Eff}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathbf{Eff}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>因而对象是带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 值对称传递等式的集合；箭头是外延、严格、单值且全定义关系的逻辑等价类。</li>\n<li>本书的主线是此逻辑构造，见 Example 6.1.2(ii)。它说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 是 topos 的后续证明位于 §§6.1–6.2。</li>\n<li>assemblies 的 exact completion 是另一条等价构造路线；本目录原先仅写未展开的 <code>Ex(Asm)</code>，无法支撑后续具体对象公式，现按本书主线展开。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Example 6.1.2(ii), pp. 376–377 (PDF 396–397); Example 6.1.8(ii), p. 383 (PDF 403)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-realizability-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"2e315868bd6a1509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-realizability-connectives","status":"resolved","id":"f36bc28426b1a7dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-realizability-connectives