ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 为 [[16-df-eff-topos]] 中由一致实现性关系构造的范畴。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["2e315868bd6a1509","e3665c73100cecbb","f36bc28426b1a7dc","58e47ffb16d63410","55e5037ed821c800"]}